    "Across ^[%lld subscription](inflect: true). Start a free trial and we'll remind you before every renewal — including this one.": {
      "comment": "A subtitle for the paywall's personalised",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Für %lld Abo. Starte eine kostenlose Testphase und wir erinnern dich vor jeder Verlängerung — auch vor dieser."
